{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/119723","id":3739075290,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7e3cLa","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119723","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119723.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119723.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119723","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/119723/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/119723/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119723/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/e56023318a3d8221ee02d0a9a04d704c714fb324","number":119723,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Improve autosmooth peformance","user":{"login":"Jesusemora","id":32273722,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyMjczNzIy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32273722?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jesusemora","html_url":"https://github.com/Jesusemora","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jesusemora/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jesusemora/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jesusemora/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jesusemora/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jesusemora/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jesusemora/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jesusemora/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jesusemora/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jesusemora/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\nThis addresses https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/119543\r\nWhile the issue has already been closed, the bad performance on autosmooth was not really solved by https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119551\r\n\r\nThis PR uses a different algorithm to calculate autosmooth by first sort of indexing vertices into a AHashMap and then using foreach to only compare vertices that are shared between the faces.\r\nThis results in much simpler code and a huge number of faces are skipped during the calculation.\r\n\r\nThis was tested and performance is much better now:\r\n\r\n4.7 beta 2: Performance is really bad with two CSGMeshes due to the high poly count\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/55b84d4d-63a4-4d58-892d-1657ca92ced1\r\n\r\nThis PR: Performance is greatly improved and almost indistinguishable from default\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/1abf1426-6e27-4593-8c24-1d3b2d7efbd5\r\n\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\nI had to delete the branching to make it compile, since `smooth_faces` is no longer used, I was waiting for https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119682 to be merged first, but decided to make use of the time I have.\r\nHowever, that PR also removes an unnecessary `vec_map` declaration, which is still in this PRs code, so either that should be merged first and then this, or I can remove it here and only merge this PR.\r\n\r\n-----\r\n\r\nNo AI used.","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708289,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4Mjg5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:3d","name":"topic:3d","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/mileston